Enumeration HomelessPrimaryNighttimeResidence [2548]
    documentation "The primary nighttime residence of the student at the time the student is identified as homeless."
    item "Doubled-up" [2548-002]
        documentation "Doubled - up (i.e., living with another family)"
    item "Hotels/motels" [2548-004]
        documentation "Hotels/motels"
    item "Shelters" [2548-001]
        documentation "Shelters, Transitional housing, Awaiting Foster Care."
    item "Unsheltered" [2548-003]
        documentation "Unsheltered (e.g. cars, parks, campgrounds, temporary trailers including FEMA trailers, or abandoned buildings)"
                     
